{"_id":"69ae18b9f9f5dab3e0905fed","title":"[BIG UPDATE]|[MOBILE PORT] WitherWare v1.5.2 by Rx!N","game":{"_id":"69a267b09d938f431278696b","gameId":123907164579958,"name":"🩸 Hidden Within","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"123907164579958-hidden-within","path":"/game/123907164579958-hidden-within","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":123907164579958},"slug":"Hidden-Within-BIG-UPDATE-n-MOBILE-PORT-WitherWare-v152-by-Rx1N-133639","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":1628,"executes":815,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/aa551b96803dad31207d793940f24678c3cb17a53f4fd0a085dac1d545d18a2d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/123907164579958-1773017273586.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/123907164579958-1773017273586.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/aa551b96803dad31207d793940f24678c3cb17a53f4fd0a085dac1d545d18a2d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/123907164579958-1773017273586.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/123907164579958-1773017273586.png"},"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-03-09T00:47:53.598Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-09T00:47:53.598Z","lastBump":"2026-03-09T00:47:53.598Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://pastebin.com/raw/nbD3D37v\"))()","features":"━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n  WitherWare  v1.5.2  —  Hidden Within Cheat Menu\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWitherWare is a feature-rich cheat menu built specifically\nfor the Roblox game \"Hidden Within\". It gives you full\nawareness of every player on the map, combat advantages,\nand quality-of-life tools — all wrapped in a clean\nmint-themed UI.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n  GETTING STARTED\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nInject the script with your executor while in-game.\nAfter about 2 seconds you'll see a notification slide\ndown from the top of your screen confirming it's active.\n\n  Button   →  Open / close the menu\n  Button   →  Toggle Better Spectator (free roam camera)\n\nThe menu has two scrollable columns. The left column\ncontains all your settings and toggles. The right column\nshows live lists of every detected killer, vigilante,\nand survivor on the map.\n\nThere is also a floating status box at the bottom of\nyour screen (toggle it with the green/red dot in the\ntop-right corner of the menu topbar) that gives you a\nquick at-a-glance view of all killers and vigilantes\nwithout needing to open the menu.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n  HOW ROLES ARE DETECTED\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nWitherWare figures out who is who by checking what\nweapon each player is holding:\n\n  • Killers     — players carrying a gun (AKM, TEC9,\n                  SMG9, or Glock 19X)\n  • Vigilante   — player carrying a Knife\n  • Survivors   — everyone else in the game with no weapon\n\nDetection is near-instant. The moment someone picks up\nor drops a weapon, their role updates immediately rather\nthan waiting for the next background scan.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n  ESP  (See Through Walls)\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nESP draws coloured outlines and info tags on players\nso you can see them through any wall at any distance.\nEach role has its own independent ESP section:\n\n  KILLERS ESP     — red outlines\n  VIGILANTE ESP   — blue outlines\n  SURVIVOR ESP    — mint/green outlines\n\nEach section can be turned on/off independently and\nhas its own dropdown with these options:\n\n  • Fill Character   — fills the player's body with\n                       a semi-transparent colour in\n                       addition to the outline\n  • Show Names       — displays the player's username\n                       above their head\n  • Show Distance    — adds how far away they are\n                       (in studs) below their name\n  • Show Health      — shows a health bar above\n                       their head that changes colour\n                       from green to red as they lose HP\n  • Outline Colour   — pick any colour for the outline\n  • Fill Colour      — pick any colour for the fill\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n  TRAILS & AWARENESS\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nFOOTSTEP TRAILS\n  Leaves glowing dots on the floor wherever tracked\n  players have walked, so you can follow their path\n  even when they've moved out of sight. Dots fade\n  and disappear after a set time.\n\n  Settings:\n  • Track Killers / Track Vigilante / Track Survivors\n    — choose which roles leave trails\n  • Duration — how long each dot lasts\n    (3 seconds / 6 seconds / 10 seconds)\n\n  And much (MUCH) more.\nHave fun!\nMade by Rx!N <3","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"69a0b92bda94309b58ec94e5","username":"TheUnknownNull","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"69a0b92bda94309b58ec94e5","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T17:26:43.484Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69ae18b9f9f5dab3e0905ff0","editBy":{"_id":"69a0b92bda94309b58ec94e5","username":"TheUnknownNull","status":"offline","id":"69a0b92bda94309b58ec94e5"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-03-09T00:47:53.602Z"},{"_id":"69b01e2ced9548b28393d18